{"seq":2,"slug":"card-redeem-balance","title":"兑换入账到储值余额","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/gift-card-stored-value/gift-card-lifecycle/card-redeem-balance","wordCount":1654,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"兑换入账到储值余额\">兑换入账到储值余额</h1><p>卡被激活之后，它的价值必须有一个去处。最常见的设计是「兑换」（redeem）：用户把卡里的钱转入自己的余额账户，之后用余额支付。这一步看似简单，却是整条链路上并发冲突最集中、幂等要求最严格的地方——因为它是<strong>两个对象之间的一次原子转账</strong>，而两端都可能被并发操作。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-兑换是一次原子转账\">核心概念：兑换是一次原子转账</h2><p>把兑换定义清楚：兑换是「从礼品卡对象扣减一定金额」+「向余额账户增加同等金额」这一对操作，它们必须在同一个事务里完成，或者全做、或者全不做。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[用户提交卡号+卡密] --&gt; B{验证卡密}&#10;    B --&gt;|失败| X1[拒绝 401]&#10;    B --&gt;|成功| C{卡状态检查}&#10;    C --&gt;|未激活| X2[拒绝: 未激活]&#10;    C --&gt;|已冻结| X3[拒绝: 已冻结]&#10;    C --&gt;|已过期| X4[按辖区规则处置]&#10;    C --&gt;|可用| D{金额判定}&#10;    D --&gt;|全额兑换| E[整额转入余额]&#10;    D --&gt;|部分兑换| F[按请求金额转入]&#10;    F --&gt;|低于最小兑换额| X5[拒绝]&#10;    E --&gt; G[写卡事件]&#10;    F --&gt; G&#10;    G --&gt; H[写余额流水]&#10;    H --&gt; I[更新卡状态]&#10;    I --&gt; J[返回新余额]\">graph TD\n    A[用户提交卡号+卡密] --&gt; B{验证卡密}\n    B --&gt;|失败| X1[拒绝 401]\n    B --&gt;|成功| C{卡状态检查}\n    C --&gt;|未激活| X2[拒绝: 未激活]\n    C --&gt;|已冻结| X3[拒绝: 已冻结]\n    C --&gt;|已过期| X4[按辖区规则处置]\n    C --&gt;|可用| D{金额判定}\n    D --&gt;|全额兑换| E[整额转入余额]\n    D --&gt;|部分兑换| F[按请求金额转入]\n    F --&gt;|低于最小兑换额| X5[拒绝]\n    E --&gt; G[写卡事件]\n    F --&gt; G\n    G --&gt; H[写余额流水]\n    H --&gt; I[更新卡状态]\n    I --&gt; J[返回新余额]</pre><p>这里有一个必须先做的业务决定：<strong>兑换是否允许部分金额</strong>。三种主流做法各有代价：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>兑换模式</th>\n<th>语义</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>仅全额兑换</td>\n<td>一次性把卡内余额全部转入</td>\n<td>卡生命周期简单，<code>ACTIVE → REDEEMED</code> 一步完成</td>\n<td>用户无法精确用掉卡里的钱；多余部分被迫留存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>允许部分兑换</td>\n<td>每次转入任意金额（设最小额）</td>\n<td>用户体验好，残值可控</td>\n<td>卡必须支持 <code>PARTIALLY_REDEEMED</code>，残值计算复杂</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>兑换即用完</td>\n<td>兑换当场把卡置为已核销，余额不可退回卡</td>\n<td>状态机最简</td>\n<td>退款时无法把价值退回原卡，见第 2 章第 2 篇</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>部分兑换是绝大多数现代电商的选择</strong>，因为它同时解决了两件事：用户可以精确控制转入金额（避免残值），退款时可以把钱退回卡（如果业务允许）。它的代价是引入 <code>PARTIALLY_REDEEMED</code> 状态与残值计算——而残值恰恰是第 3 章的核心议题，见<a href=\"../expiry-residual/residual-value\">残值处理与休眠余额</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"兑换的原子性与幂等键\">兑换的原子性与幂等键</h2><p>兑换接口的输入是 <code>(cardId, pin, amountMinor, idempotencyKey)</code>。它的实现必须满足三条：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>卡密校验与扣减在同一事务内</strong>——不能在事务外校验完卡密再进事务扣减，否则两次并发请求都能通过校验。</li>\n<li><strong>卡行必须加锁</strong>——<code>SELECT ... FOR UPDATE</code> 或等效的乐观锁版本号。</li>\n<li><strong>幂等键来自客户端</strong>——同一个 <code>idempotencyKey</code> 的重复请求，返回第一次的结果，不重复入账。</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"async function redeem(req: RedeemRequest): Promise&lt;RedeemResult&gt; {&#10;  return db.transaction(async (tx) =&gt; {&#10;    const prior = await tx.redemptions.findByKey(req.idempotencyKey);&#10;    if (prior) return prior.result;&#10;&#10;    const card = await tx.giftCards.lockForUpdate(req.cardId);&#10;    const ctx = checkCardUsable(card, req.amountMinor);&#10;    if (!ctx.ok) return { ok: false, reason: ctx.reason };&#10;&#10;    if (!verifyPin(req.pin, card.pinHash, card.salt)) return { ok: false, reason: &#39;BAD_PIN&#39; };&#10;&#10;    const entry = await tx.ledger.append({&#10;      accountId: ctx.accountId,&#10;      direction: &#39;CREDIT&#39;,&#10;      amountMinor: req.amountMinor,&#10;      currency: card.currency,&#10;      source: { kind: &#39;GIFT_CARD_REDEEM&#39;, cardId: card.id },&#10;      idempotencyKey: req.idempotencyKey,&#10;      at: now(),&#10;    });&#10;&#10;    await tx.giftCards.update(card.id, {&#10;      remainingMinor: card.remainingMinor - req.amountMinor,&#10;      status: card.remainingMinor - req.amountMinor === 0 ? &#39;REDEEMED&#39; : &#39;PARTIALLY_REDEEMED&#39;,&#10;    });&#10;&#10;    const result = { ok: true, creditedMinor: req.amountMinor, ledgerEntryId: entry.id };&#10;    await tx.redemptions.insert({ idempotencyKey: req.idempotencyKey, result, at: now() });&#10;    return result;&#10;  });&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> redeem</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">req</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> RedeemRequest</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">RedeemResult</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> db.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">transaction</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">tx</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> prior</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tx.redemptions.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">findByKey</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(req.idempotencyKey);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (prior) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prior.result;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> card</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tx.giftCards.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">lockForUpdate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(req.cardId);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ctx</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> checkCardUsable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(card, req.amountMinor);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ctx.ok) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { ok: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, reason: ctx.reason };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">verifyPin</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(req.pin, card.pinHash, card.salt)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { ok: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, reason: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'BAD_PIN'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> entry</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tx.ledger.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">append</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      accountId: ctx.accountId,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      direction: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CREDIT'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      amountMinor: req.amountMinor,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      currency: card.currency,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      source: { kind: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'GIFT_CARD_REDEEM'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, cardId: card.id },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      idempotencyKey: req.idempotencyKey,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      at: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tx.giftCards.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">update</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(card.id, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      remainingMinor: card.remainingMinor </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> req.amountMinor,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      status: card.remainingMinor </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> req.amountMinor </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ?</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'REDEEMED'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> :</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'PARTIALLY_REDEEMED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> result</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { ok: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, creditedMinor: req.amountMinor, ledgerEntryId: entry.id };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tx.redemptions.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">insert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ idempotencyKey: req.idempotencyKey, result, at: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>三个字段决定了这段代码的正确性。<strong><code>idempotencyKey</code> 的唯一约束</strong>是防重复入账的硬保证——注意它同时被写在 <code>redemptions</code> 表和 <code>ledger</code> 表上，两层都加唯一约束，因为网络重试与客户端 bug 是两件不同的事。<strong><code>lockForUpdate</code></strong> 保证并发兑换同一张卡时只有一次能读到正确的 <code>remainingMinor</code>。<strong><code>status</code> 的更新由剩余金额推导</strong>，不依赖调用方传入，避免出现「金额扣光了但状态还是 ACTIVE」的不一致。</p>\n<p>这里有一个与本文档强相关、但主篇在别处的细节：<strong>兑换入账的流水是余额账户的贷方（CREDIT）</strong>，方向的定义与借贷含义见<a href=\"../stored-balance/balance-ledger\">余额账户与只追加流水</a>；本文只保证「卡减多少、账户加多少」，不重复讲记账模型。</p>\n<h2 id=\"卡的有效性与到期判定\">卡的有效性与到期判定</h2><p>在扣减之前必须判定卡能不能用。判定顺序有实际影响：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function checkCardUsable(card: Card, amount: number): UsableResult {&#10;  if (!card) return { ok: false, reason: &#39;NOT_FOUND&#39; };&#10;  if (card.status === &#39;VOID&#39;) return { ok: false, reason: &#39;VOID&#39; };&#10;  if (card.status === &#39;FROZEN&#39;) return { ok: false, reason: &#39;FROZEN&#39; };&#10;  if (card.status === &#39;ISSUED&#39;) return { ok: false, reason: &#39;NOT_ACTIVATED&#39; };&#10;  if (card.status === &#39;REDEEMED&#39;) return { ok: false, reason: &#39;NO_REMAINING&#39; };&#10;  if (hasExpired(card, jurisdictionOf(card))) return { ok: false, reason: &#39;EXPIRED&#39; };&#10;  if (amount &lt;= 0) return { ok: false, reason: &#39;BAD_AMOUNT&#39; };&#10;  if (amount &gt; card.remainingMinor) return { ok: false, reason: &#39;INSUFFICIENT_CARD&#39; };&#10;  if (amount &lt; card.minRedeemMinor) return { ok: false, reason: &#39;BELOW_MIN_REDEEM&#39; };&#10;  return { ok: true, accountId: card.ownerAccountId };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> checkCardUsable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">card</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Card</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">amount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> UsableResult</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">card) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { ok: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, reason: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'NOT_FOUND'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (card.status </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'VOID'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { ok: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, reason: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'VOID'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (card.status </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'FROZEN'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { ok: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, reason: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'FROZEN'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (card.status </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ISSUED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { ok: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, reason: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'NOT_ACTIVATED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (card.status </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'REDEEMED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { ok: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, reason: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'NO_REMAINING'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">hasExpired</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(card, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">jurisdictionOf</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(card))) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { ok: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, reason: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'EXPIRED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (amount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { ok: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, reason: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'BAD_AMOUNT'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (amount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> card.remainingMinor) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { ok: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, reason: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'INSUFFICIENT_CARD'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (amount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> card.minRedeemMinor) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { ok: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, reason: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'BELOW_MIN_REDEEM'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { ok: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, accountId: card.ownerAccountId };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>hasExpired</code> 是刻意留成一个抽象函数而不是 <code>card.expireAt &lt; now()</code>。原因是<strong>到期日是辖区相关的派生值</strong>，同一张卡在美国某州可能法定不得在五年内失效，而在另一个市场可能允许更短的有效期，且部分市场对「充值型」与「礼品型」适用不同规则。把到期判定集中到一个可替换的函数里，是第 3 章<a href=\"../expiry-residual/card-expiry-rules\">过期规则与地区法规差异</a>能够在系统里落地的前提。<strong>不要在卡行上只存一个 <code>expire_at</code> 字段就完事</strong>——那是本 hub 反复出现的反模式。</p>\n<p><strong>最小兑换额</strong>（<code>minRedeemMinor</code>）不是可选的。没有它，用户可以反复小额兑换把卡刷成碎片，产生大量流水，且在第 3 章的休眠与残值判断中制造噪音。典型取值是「币种的一个有意义单位」（如 1 元、1 美元），但必须小于卡的最低面值，否则某批低面值卡永远无法兑换。</p>\n<h2 id=\"兑换失败的资金无损耗\">兑换失败的资金无损耗</h2><p>兑换失败时最要警惕的是<strong>部分成功</strong>。考虑这个场景：账户入账成功、卡扣减成功，但写 <code>redemptions</code> 幂等记录时数据库连接断了。如果这三步不在同一事务里，结果是账户多了一笔钱、卡少了一笔钱，而幂等记录缺失——用户重试会<strong>再入账一次</strong>，造成资损。</p>\n<p>防线是单一事务 + 唯一约束的组合：事务回滚会把入账和扣减一起撤销；唯一约束会在幂等记录冲突时把重试导向「读取已有结果」而不是「重新入账」。两层都必需，因为事务保证原子性、约束保证幂等性，而这两个性质不能互相替代——事务不能阻止「事务完整提交两次」，约束不能阻止「半个事务提交」。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[兑换请求] --&gt; B{幂等键已存在?}&#10;    B --&gt;|是| C[返回已存结果]&#10;    B --&gt;|否| D[开启事务]&#10;    D --&gt; E[锁定卡行]&#10;    E --&gt; F[校验卡密与状态]&#10;    F --&gt;|失败| G[回滚]&#10;    F --&gt;|成功| H[写账户流水]&#10;    H --&gt; I[更新卡余额与状态]&#10;    I --&gt; J{写幂等记录}&#10;    J --&gt;|唯一冲突| K[回滚并读取已有结果]&#10;    J --&gt;|成功| L[提交]&#10;    G --&gt; M[返回业务拒绝]&#10;    K --&gt; C&#10;    L --&gt; N[返回成功与新余额]\">graph TD\n    A[兑换请求] --&gt; B{幂等键已存在?}\n    B --&gt;|是| C[返回已存结果]\n    B --&gt;|否| D[开启事务]\n    D --&gt; E[锁定卡行]\n    E --&gt; F[校验卡密与状态]\n    F --&gt;|失败| G[回滚]\n    F --&gt;|成功| H[写账户流水]\n    H --&gt; I[更新卡余额与状态]\n    I --&gt; J{写幂等记录}\n    J --&gt;|唯一冲突| K[回滚并读取已有结果]\n    J --&gt;|成功| L[提交]\n    G --&gt; M[返回业务拒绝]\n    K --&gt; C\n    L --&gt; N[返回成功与新余额]</pre><p><strong>回滚后返回什么？</strong> 业务拒绝（如卡密错误、余额不足）应该返回明确的错误码，且<strong>不消耗幂等键</strong>——用户改对卡密后重试应该能成功。这与「网络故障导致的不确定性失败」不同，后者必须保留幂等键以便重试时得到同一结果。区分这两类失败是接口设计的基本功：确定性业务失败不占幂等键，不确定性技术失败占。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>兑换是两个对象之间的原子转账</strong>：卡扣减与账户入账必须在同一事务内完成，部分成功是本环节最大的资损来源。</li>\n<li><strong>部分兑换是主流选择</strong>，代价是引入 <code>PARTIALLY_REDEEMED</code> 状态与残值计算；<code>minRedeemMinor</code> 不是可选项，没有它会产生碎片流水与判定噪音。</li>\n<li><strong>幂等靠两层</strong>：事务保证原子性、唯一约束（<code>redemptions.idempotencyKey</code> + <code>ledger.idempotencyKey</code>）保证幂等性，两者不可互相替代。</li>\n<li><strong>卡行必须加锁</strong>（<code>SELECT ... FOR UPDATE</code> 或乐观锁版本号），且 <code>status</code> 由剩余金额推导而非由调用方传入。</li>\n<li><strong>到期判定必须是可替换的抽象函数</strong>（<code>hasExpired(card, jurisdiction)</code>），而不是卡行上的单个 <code>expire_at</code>；原因是到期规则按辖区不同，详见第 3 章。</li>\n<li><strong>确定性业务失败不消耗幂等键，不确定性技术失败必须保留幂等键</strong>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>兑换之后，价值进入了余额账户，接下来的记账模型见<a href=\"../stored-balance/balance-ledger\">余额账户与只追加流水</a>；卡在兑换之前发生所有权转移的情形，见<a href=\"card-transfer-gift\">礼品卡转赠与受赠</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"兑换入账到储值余额","id":"兑换入账到储值余额"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：兑换是一次原子转账","id":"核心概念-兑换是一次原子转账"},{"level":2,"text":"兑换的原子性与幂等键","id":"兑换的原子性与幂等键"},{"level":2,"text":"卡的有效性与到期判定","id":"卡的有效性与到期判定"},{"level":2,"text":"兑换失败的资金无损耗","id":"兑换失败的资金无损耗"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"礼品卡发行、购买与激活","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/gift-card-stored-value/gift-card-lifecycle/card-issue-purchase"},"next":{"title":"礼品卡转赠与受赠","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/gift-card-stored-value/gift-card-lifecycle/card-transfer-gift"}}